      ## Traits

      ***Water Breathing.*** The shark can breathe only underwater.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The shark makes two Bite attacks.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]) (with ***Advantage*** if the target doesn't have all its ***Hit Points***), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d10+6,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage.

